      "id": "pOqHI65vtU-x_eO0Ls0Um",
      "index": "a4",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "铁律一：输入输出指针固定\n\n• 捕获硬编码张量虚拟地址 (data_ptr)\n• 重放必须原位 copy_() 覆写静态缓冲\n• 重新赋值将导致图死读旧 0x7f00_1000\n• 末图启用 weak_ref_tensors() 释放中间结果",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1826724982,
      "strokeColor": "#1d1d1f",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "铁律一：输入输出指针固定\n\n• 捕获硬编码张量虚拟地址 (data_ptr)\n• 重放必须原位 copy_() 覆写静态缓冲\n• 重新赋值将导致图死读旧 0x7f00_1000\n• 末图启用 weak_ref_tensors() 释放中间结果",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "type": "text",
      "updated": 1,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 237810038,
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "width": 299.3758239746094,
      "x": 14.312088012695312,
      "y": 19.5
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": "b2",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "height": 105,
      "id": "dn84fL876InYfhP9deo_B",
      "index": "a5",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "铁律二：静态批形与零分配\n\n• 真实 Batch 必须垫齐进 Capture 桶\n• 禁止图内按运行时标量动态申请张量\n• 捕获共享 global_graph_pool 控制显存\n• 填充槽 slot_mapping 须显式刷写为 -1",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 446864822,
      "strokeColor": "#1d1d1f",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "铁律二：静态批形与零分配\n\n• 真实 Batch 必须垫齐进 Capture 桶\n• 禁止图内按运行时标量动态申请张量\n• 捕获共享 global_graph_pool 控制显存\n• 填充槽 slot_mapping 须显式刷写为 -1",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "type": "text",
      "updated": 1,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1028245738,
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "width": 257.1378173828125,
      "x": 387.43109130859375,
      "y": 19.5
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
