      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "铁律三：零主机控制流同步\n\n• 严禁图内调用 .item() / .cpu() / .tolist()\n• 严禁数据依赖分支与 torch.nonzero()\n• 分支条件须前置至 Runner CPU 侧\n• 违例直接触发 StreamCaptureUnsupported",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 53573366,
      "strokeColor": "#1d1d1f",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "铁律三：零主机控制流同步\n\n• 严禁图内调用 .item() / .cpu() / .tolist()\n• 严禁数据依赖分支与 torch.nonzero()\n• 分支条件须前置至 Runner CPU 侧\n• 违例直接触发 StreamCaptureUnsupported",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "type": "text",
      "updated": 1,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1807946422,
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "width": 288.32977294921875,
