      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "铁律四：副流闭环与通信池隔离\n\n• 旁路拷贝流必须经 Event 汇回主流\n• Offloader 末尾执行 join_after_forward()\n• 对称内存切换至 nccl_symm_mem_context\n• 暂停 graph_pool 后登记跨卡通信窗地址",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1058220086,
      "strokeColor": "#1d1d1f",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "铁律四：副流闭环与通信池隔离\n\n• 旁路拷贝流必须经 Event 汇回主流\n• Offloader 末尾执行 join_after_forward()\n• 对称内存切换至 nccl_symm_mem_context\n• 暂停 graph_pool 后登记跨卡通信窗地址",
      "textAlign": "center",
